WEBVTT

00:00:02.170 --> 00:00:16.520
Monsters do have their place in the zoo, in your nightmares, in the deep, in your favorite horror movies, not in your living room, on your TV.

00:00:17.540 --> 00:00:25.580
Don't let pay TV be the monster in your living room.

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:29.980
Pay TV and cable TV companies are seeking the right to charge you.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.010
for the very programs you now get free if you want to stop pay tv and save free television

00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:41.700
sign the petition in the lobby of this theater let your lawmakers know how you feel in the fight

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:43.800
against ATV and Cable TV.
